1
00:00:25,330 --> 00:00:28,130
♪Break the chain, erase the curl♪

2
00:00:28,420 --> 00:00:31,090
♪I rise up with my inner pearl♪

3
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:34,190
♪Self-rescue fire burning full♪

4
00:00:34,570 --> 00:00:37,620
♪I'm the master of my rule♪

5
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:40,050
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

6
00:00:40,250 --> 00:00:43,030
♪Calm but full of pearl♪

7
00:00:44,010 --> 00:00:46,010
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

8
00:00:46,220 --> 00:00:49,260
♪I rule my whole own whirl♪

9
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:53,560
=Quite The Girl=

10
00:00:53,560 --> 00:00:54,446
(Adapted from the Tomato novel
"Quite The Girl.")

11
00:00:54,446 --> 00:00:54,993
(Author: Wo Shafei Kuxin)

12
00:00:54,993 --> 00:00:55,906
=Episode 18=

13
00:00:58,144 --> 00:01:00,283
(Cashier)

14
00:01:03,119 --> 00:01:04,599
Mr. Zhou's pottery

15
00:01:05,079 --> 00:01:06,680
should be in the collection room
at the back.

16
00:01:06,959 --> 00:01:07,400
How?

17
00:01:09,879 --> 00:01:10,439
You steal it.

18
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:14,000
(Cashier)

19
00:01:16,840 --> 00:01:17,480
Sorry...

20
00:01:17,480 --> 00:01:18,359
We're closed.

21
00:01:19,300 --> 00:01:20,200
(Wu Yue Keepsake)

22
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:23,640
I just flew back from abroad.

23
00:01:23,799 --> 00:01:24,920
I'm only here a few hours.

24
00:01:27,719 --> 00:01:28,640
Here's my card.

25
00:01:30,040 --> 00:01:31,120
Tell your manager

26
00:01:31,120 --> 00:01:32,200
that I'm here.

27
00:01:32,519 --> 00:01:33,799
He'll make an exception.

28
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:37,159
He's already shown me

29
00:01:37,159 --> 00:01:38,640
the other pieces in the hall.

30
00:01:40,359 --> 00:01:41,280
But honestly,

31
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:43,159
those pieces don't compare to you.

32
00:01:44,480 --> 00:01:46,159
You flatter me.

33
00:01:47,480 --> 00:01:48,120
Got a lighter?

34
00:01:48,599 --> 00:01:49,159
I'll get one.

35
00:02:03,879 --> 00:02:04,359
Sir.

36
00:02:04,840 --> 00:02:05,280
Thanks.

37
00:02:07,171 --> 00:02:08,751
(Cashier)

38
00:02:09,866 --> 00:02:11,513
(Restrooms)

39
00:02:23,159 --> 00:02:23,960
Light it for me.

40
00:02:38,319 --> 00:02:39,280
(Intruder Alert)

41
00:02:39,360 --> 00:02:40,800
(Intruder Alert)

42
00:02:50,759 --> 00:02:51,520
Why are you here?

43
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:53,000
I can't leave my employee

44
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:53,520
stuck here alone.

45
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:55,599
Did you find Mr. Zhou's pottery?

46
00:02:56,080 --> 00:02:56,680
No.

47
00:02:57,280 --> 00:02:58,120
Maybe it's not here.

48
00:02:58,719 --> 00:02:59,360
What now?

49
00:03:00,479 --> 00:03:01,360
Let me think.

50
00:03:15,708 --> 00:03:19,088
(Pine and Crane for Longevity)

51
00:03:21,599 --> 00:03:23,000
My grandpa painted this.

52
00:03:23,479 --> 00:03:25,159
No wonder your art has such soul.

53
00:03:25,879 --> 00:03:26,960
You got it from him.

54
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:33,479
Since we're stuck here,

55
00:03:33,759 --> 00:03:34,280
light it for me.

56
00:03:35,840 --> 00:03:36,479
My fire

57
00:03:36,479 --> 00:03:38,400
isn't as hot as the receptionist's.

58
00:03:39,919 --> 00:03:40,479
Jealous?

59
00:03:41,479 --> 00:03:42,479
You're joking, Mr. Duan.

60
00:04:02,208 --> 00:04:03,400
(Honor the Legacy, Carry On the Lus)

61
00:04:03,400 --> 00:04:04,240
(Chengye.)

62
00:04:05,479 --> 00:04:06,759
(That's my father's name.)

63
00:04:07,759 --> 00:04:10,039
(So my father was the chosen heir.)

64
00:04:19,199 --> 00:04:20,319
I know how to get out.

65
00:04:29,079 --> 00:04:30,079
Why so much smoke?

66
00:04:30,360 --> 00:04:31,480
Is something on fire?

67
00:04:31,680 --> 00:04:32,240
Control room!

68
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:34,439
Open the door to Warehouse 3! Now!

69
00:04:43,519 --> 00:04:45,560
It's a shame we couldn't
get Zhou Yishan.

70
00:04:47,160 --> 00:04:48,240
Since we can't get him,

71
00:04:48,959 --> 00:04:50,519
let's focus on the exhibits.

72
00:04:50,800 --> 00:04:51,800
Make every piece

73
00:04:51,839 --> 00:04:54,160
a rare find on the market.

74
00:04:54,319 --> 00:04:55,959
So you have a backup plan.

75
00:04:56,160 --> 00:04:57,199
Let's hear it.

76
00:04:57,800 --> 00:04:59,240
Like the Lu family heirlooms.

77
00:04:59,839 --> 00:05:02,079
Fill the show with pieces like that,

78
00:05:02,759 --> 00:05:04,199
and it'll draw a crowd.

79
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:17,199
I'm curious, though.

80
00:05:17,319 --> 00:05:18,839
Are you helping the Lus

81
00:05:19,399 --> 00:05:20,639
or hurting them?

82
00:05:25,839 --> 00:05:26,920
The one I want to help

83
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:30,240
is Dongchen.

84
00:05:31,959 --> 00:05:33,199
Perfect answer.

85
00:05:35,079 --> 00:05:37,319
Then let the Lus join the bidding.

86
00:05:38,560 --> 00:05:39,399
Fair competition.

87
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:43,439
(And check Grandpa's real will.)

88
00:05:44,399 --> 00:05:45,680
I won't ask how you took

89
00:05:45,680 --> 00:05:46,680
Lu Qian's place

90
00:05:47,160 --> 00:05:47,839
to get into Dongchen.

91
00:05:49,319 --> 00:05:50,480
But after all this time,

92
00:05:50,959 --> 00:05:52,160
shouldn't you find

93
00:05:52,160 --> 00:05:53,600
some deals for the family?

94
00:05:54,199 --> 00:05:55,480
There's one right now.

95
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:57,959
Dongchen is planning an art show.

96
00:05:58,839 --> 00:06:00,120
They want the Lu family

97
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:02,399
to lend Grandpa's ceramic antique

98
00:06:02,399 --> 00:06:03,680
for the show.

99
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:04,519
That ceramic piece

100
00:06:04,519 --> 00:06:06,040
is a family heirloom.

101
00:06:06,639 --> 00:06:07,800
It can't go on display.

102
00:06:08,879 --> 00:06:09,519
Dad.

103
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:11,079
This is a rare chance.

104
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:14,079
Dongchen is the hottest name in Xizi.

105
00:06:14,560 --> 00:06:16,040
Why not seize this chance

106
00:06:16,279 --> 00:06:17,360
to build ties with them?

107
00:06:25,839 --> 00:06:27,360
You don't run the family.

108
00:06:31,360 --> 00:06:32,199
But we shouldn't waste

109
00:06:32,199 --> 00:06:33,680
this opportunity.

110
00:06:35,839 --> 00:06:36,600
You take charge

111
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:38,199
of this bid.

112
00:06:56,519 --> 00:06:57,639
(Here's the file for Mr. Duan.)

113
00:06:57,759 --> 00:06:59,079
(Check it again
before you gave it to him.)

114
00:06:59,360 --> 00:06:59,800
(Okay.)

115
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:00,360
(Go.)

116
00:07:00,879 --> 00:07:01,439
Mingyu.

117
00:07:02,839 --> 00:07:03,959
Before the bidding,

118
00:07:04,240 --> 00:07:05,879
introduce me to Dongchen's

119
00:07:06,079 --> 00:07:06,560
president.

120
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:08,040
Okay.

121
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:14,079
Duan Xiuming?

122
00:07:15,399 --> 00:07:16,600
Didn't you cut ties with him?

123
00:07:16,680 --> 00:07:17,480
Why is he here?

124
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:19,399
There's nothing between us.

125
00:07:19,639 --> 00:07:21,120
It has nothing to do with me.

126
00:07:25,680 --> 00:07:26,319
Uncle Lu.

127
00:07:26,800 --> 00:07:28,160
Duan Xiuming, I'm warning you.

128
00:07:28,519 --> 00:07:29,839
Know your place.

129
00:07:29,839 --> 00:07:30,879
Stay away from Mingyu.

130
00:07:31,240 --> 00:07:33,240
Or I won't spare your dignity.

131
00:07:33,519 --> 00:07:34,319
Sorry.

132
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:35,959
But I'll have to disappoint you.

133
00:07:36,120 --> 00:07:38,040
Mingyu and I will probably see
each other every day.

134
00:07:38,639 --> 00:07:39,839
Dream on.

135
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:42,399
Mingyu.

136
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:44,600
Cut him off once and for all.

137
00:07:44,959 --> 00:07:45,959
Make him give up.

138
00:07:46,360 --> 00:07:46,959
Miss Lu.

139
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:48,839
How will you make me give up?

140
00:07:49,859 --> 00:07:52,746
♪They think I'm weak, easy to control♪

141
00:07:52,759 --> 00:07:55,040
Mr. Duan, here's today's agenda.

142
00:07:55,560 --> 00:07:56,439
Please review it.

143
00:07:56,439 --> 00:07:58,679
♪Bite back tears, hold every pain♪

144
00:07:58,680 --> 00:07:59,639
What did you call him?

145
00:07:59,639 --> 00:08:02,139
♪Silently plan to break the chain♪

146
00:08:03,399 --> 00:08:04,360
Allow me to introduce myself.

147
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:07,040
Duan Xiuming,
President of Dongchen Group.

148
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:09,439
Miss Lu Mingyu is my assistant.

149
00:08:09,439 --> 00:08:12,566
♪I don't wait for someone to save me♪

150
00:08:12,784 --> 00:08:15,697
♪Don't beg for mercy,
don't bow down freely♪

151
00:08:15,894 --> 00:08:18,767
♪Wisdom sharp like blade unseen♪

152
00:08:18,808 --> 00:08:21,263
♪I hold my fate within my hand clean♪

153
00:08:22,279 --> 00:08:23,079
Don't worry.

154
00:08:23,240 --> 00:08:24,720
Since you're Mingyu's uncle,

155
00:08:24,959 --> 00:08:26,079
publicly or privately,

156
00:08:26,279 --> 00:08:27,399
I'll give your family's bid

157
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:29,079
special consideration.

158
00:08:29,560 --> 00:08:30,040
Uncle Lu.

159
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:34,193
♪Rule my world, set myself free♪

160
00:08:34,356 --> 00:08:36,702
♪No more bondage, no more deceit♪

161
00:08:36,803 --> 00:08:40,116
♪My own salvation I believe♪

162
00:08:40,538 --> 00:08:42,951
♪Burn the haze, break every siege♪

163
00:08:43,105 --> 00:08:46,512
♪I'm the queen of my own destiny♪

164
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:53,519
Yue.

165
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:54,840
Lin.

166
00:08:55,039 --> 00:08:57,120
I heard you'll speak at the bid

167
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:58,000
on behalf of the family.

168
00:08:58,080 --> 00:08:58,960
So impressive.

169
00:08:59,000 --> 00:08:59,720
Good luck.

170
00:08:59,720 --> 00:09:00,720
Don't worry, Suyue.

171
00:09:00,919 --> 00:09:02,480
I've prepared for a long time.

172
00:09:02,919 --> 00:09:04,120
This is just the start.

173
00:09:04,360 --> 00:09:05,799
Once I take over the Lu family,

174
00:09:05,919 --> 00:09:08,159
I'll transform it completely.

175
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:10,200
My dad's way

176
00:09:10,279 --> 00:09:11,720
is way too old-school.

177
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:14,799
It can't keep up with the times.

178
00:09:27,639 --> 00:09:29,919
(Xu Suyue)
(I never thought I'd use my charms.)

179
00:09:40,976 --> 00:09:45,490
(Dongchen Art Show Project Bidding)

180
00:09:45,559 --> 00:09:46,200
Next.

181
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:48,759
The Lu Group's representative, please.

182
00:10:01,400 --> 00:10:04,460
(Dongchen Art Show Bidding)

183
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:05,720
Hello, everyone.

184
00:10:05,919 --> 00:10:08,000
I'm Lu Qiuliang, head of the Lu Group.

185
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:10,639
I'll now walk you through

186
00:10:10,639 --> 00:10:11,679
our proposal.

187
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:14,080
Please look at the screen.

188
00:10:42,519 --> 00:10:44,120
So the one who crashed the wedding

189
00:10:44,279 --> 00:10:46,559
was Dongchen's powerful president.

190
00:10:47,559 --> 00:10:49,200
My cousin's so lucky.

191
00:10:49,399 --> 00:10:50,279
You've got it wrong.

192
00:10:51,039 --> 00:10:52,720
We were just playing along.

193
00:10:52,759 --> 00:10:53,840
We both got what we wanted.

194
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:54,600
Lin.

195
00:10:54,919 --> 00:10:56,960
We're just work partners.

196
00:10:57,159 --> 00:10:58,399
Work partners?

197
00:10:59,200 --> 00:11:00,120
Easy for you to say.

198
00:11:06,840 --> 00:11:07,960
(Dongchen Art Show Proposal)
I read the proposal

199
00:11:07,960 --> 00:11:09,039
you threw away carefully.

200
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:10,559
It's better than Lu Qiuliang's.

201
00:11:13,639 --> 00:11:14,559
Too bad.

202
00:11:14,840 --> 00:11:16,480
My cousin should've given the speech.

203
00:11:17,320 --> 00:11:18,440
But for some reason,

204
00:11:18,879 --> 00:11:20,480
Uncle changed his mind.

205
00:11:20,799 --> 00:11:21,879
There's still a chance.

206
00:11:22,320 --> 00:11:23,440
At tomorrow's art show,

207
00:11:23,480 --> 00:11:24,960
if you represent the Lu family

208
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:26,759
and display the antique,

209
00:11:27,159 --> 00:11:29,600
I'll consider a deal led by you.

210
00:11:31,480 --> 00:11:32,159
Mr. Duan.

211
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:34,600
Don't put Lin on the spot.

212
00:11:35,120 --> 00:11:37,480
Uncle won't agree to display it.

213
00:11:37,720 --> 00:11:39,200
We shouldn't break the rules.

214
00:11:39,600 --> 00:11:40,320
Rules

215
00:11:41,639 --> 00:11:43,039
are made to be broken.

216
00:11:44,720 --> 00:11:46,960
Especially by the future heir.

217
00:11:47,559 --> 00:11:48,639
Bring it tomorrow,

218
00:11:49,200 --> 00:11:52,639
and Dongchen will fully support you
in taking control of the Lu family.

219
00:11:57,919 --> 00:11:59,159
The more he refuses,

220
00:12:00,600 --> 00:12:01,840
the more I want it.

221
00:12:36,236 --> 00:12:40,856
♪Snapping the sweetest noon♪

222
00:12:43,316 --> 00:12:47,236
♪The sun and you are gentle♪

223
00:12:50,336 --> 00:12:55,026
♪Summer wakes up right now♪

224
00:12:56,146 --> 00:13:01,096
♪Chimes and cicadas have loved so long♪

225
00:13:03,486 --> 00:13:09,666
♪A love letter written in song♪

226
00:13:10,366 --> 00:13:15,176
♪A gentle kiss upon your brow♪

227
00:13:17,686 --> 00:13:23,616
♪Dragonflies glide as butterflies dance♪

228
00:13:24,386 --> 00:13:30,406
♪We mark this moment with a kite♪

229
00:13:30,666 --> 00:13:37,586
♪Gemini's joy lets art fill our love♪

230
00:13:38,546 --> 00:13:41,076
♪Close your eyes and count♪

231
00:13:41,116 --> 00:13:43,716
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪

232
00:13:43,716 --> 00:13:50,216
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪
